Upe
$cards
DECK 1 {SPADES, HEARTS, CLUBS, DIAMONDS}

$initial
DRAW 7 ROTATE 3 U 2
TRIFA 1 FACE_LAST
TRIFA 3 FACE_LAST
TRIFA 8 FACE_LAST
TRIFA 8 FACE_LAST
TRIFA 8 FACE_LAST
TRIFA 7 FACE_LAST
TRIFA 2 FACE_LAST
TRIFA 1 FACE_LAST
TRIFA 7 FACE_LAST

$moves
MOVE_STACK TRIFA TRIFA
DEST Size > 0
$win
OR
    PILE ALL TRIFA Empty
    PILE ALL DRAW Empty
